<title>CANADA: Pacalta completes Ecuador oil acquisition.</title>
<headline>Pacalta completes Ecuador oil acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian oil company Pacalta Resources Ltd said on Friday it closed its acquisition of Ecuador's City Investing Co Ltd shares it did not previously own.</p>
<p>Pacalta said the US$40 million purchase gives it complete ownership of City.</p>
<p>City's main oil assets are the City Block and Block 27 in Ecuador.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
